# macOS defaults

`macos/defaults.sh` must remain a no-op until `macos/harvested.flags` exists. Do not `defaults write` Liquid Glass, natural scrolling, key repeat, keyboard layouts, or Dock from guesswork.

## Capture / compare

- `./macos/capture.sh <label>` → `macos/snapshots/<label>/` (text dumps only).
- Commit `macos/snapshots/vm/` as the UTM baseline. Other labels are gitignored.
- `./macos/compare.sh vm metal` shows diffs; the user chooses what to harvest — never auto-apply a full metal dump.
- Expand domains in `macos/capture.sh` when needed; re-capture both sides before comparing.

When harvesting from bare metal, follow `macos/CAPTURE.md`. Keep machine UUIDs and iCloud identifiers out of git. Plists stay gitignored until reviewed.

Same bootstrap on VM and metal. Detect VM vs hardware only if a setting cannot apply in UTM — not a second installer.
